15210 BONUSLIFE%=PBON%(CURPL%):NHOME%=PNH%(CURPL%):RESPAWN%=PRSP%(CURPL%)
15215 FOR PL%=0 TO 4:HFILL%(PL%)=PHF%(CURPL%,PL%):NEXT PL%
