15240 PBON%(CURPL%)=BONUSLIFE%:PNH%(CURPL%)=NHOME%:PRSP%(CURPL%)=RESPAWN%
15245 FOR PL%=0 TO 4:PHF%(CURPL%,PL%)=HFILL%(PL%):NEXT PL%
